00:35:56.000 --> 00:36:00.000
my case, and he had watched Tom Drake's case, Tom Drake, the NSA whistle

00:36:00.000 --> 00:36:06.000
blower. And neither one of us backed down despite the enormous pressure

00:36:06.000 --> 00:36:11.000
that we were under. And so we had inspired him to go public with his

00:36:11.000 --> 00:36:15.000
revelations. And I got to tell you that and one other thing that also

00:36:15.000 --> 00:36:21.000
happened in December of 14 made it all worthwhile. The other thing was

00:36:22.000 --> 00:36:25.000
I'm sitting there in my cell one day, and a guy walks in and says,

00:36:25.000 --> 00:36:30.000
Hey, buddy, you're on TV. I said, Oh, okay. I got up. I walked over the TV.

00:36:31.000 --> 00:36:36.000
And it was John McCain standing on the floor of the Senate, saying that

00:36:37.000 --> 00:36:41.000
without my revelations, the American people would never have known that

00:36:41.000 --> 00:36:45.000
there was a torture program, and that they were torturing people in the

00:36:45.000 --> 00:36:49.000
name of the American people. He said, even though I was in prison,

00:36:49.000 --> 00:36:53.000
that I deserved the thanks of the American public. And he was happy

00:36:53.000 --> 00:36:58.000
to do that from the floor of the Senate. That completely changed the way

00:36:58.000 --> 00:37:05.000
that I saw myself. You know, CNN, until the day before I went to prison,

00:37:05.000 --> 00:37:11.000
called me CIA leaker, John Kiriakou. They changed it to CIA torture

00:37:11.000 --> 00:37:14.000
whistleblower, John Kiriakou, the day before I went to prison.

00:37:14.000 --> 00:37:18.000
Fox for whatever odd reason, probably because I was prosecuted by

00:37:18.000 --> 00:37:24.000
Obama, always called me CIA torture whistleblower, John Kiriakou.

00:37:24.000 --> 00:37:30.000
MSNBC, which was pretty much the Obama network, called me CIA leaker,

00:37:30.000 --> 00:37:35.000
John Kiriakou, or John Kiriakou, who styles himself a whistleblower,

00:37:35.000 --> 00:37:42.000
which still makes me angry to this day. But you know, this is just

00:37:42.000 --> 00:37:46.000
the way it is. Now, what's happened since I got out of prison

00:37:46.000 --> 00:37:53.000
in February of 2015 is all of us Obama-era whistleblowers

00:37:53.000 --> 00:37:58.000
