00:38:09.000 --> 00:38:13.000
Tom Drake, Ed Snowden, the godfather of whistleblowing,

00:38:13.000 --> 00:38:18.000
the great, heroic Daniel Ellsberg. There are a bunch of us,

00:38:18.000 --> 00:38:22.000
