00:38:22.000 --> 00:38:25.000
and I'm happy to do it, and I do it several times a week,

00:38:25.000 --> 00:38:30.000
is to advise other would-be whistleblowers so that they

00:38:30.000 --> 00:38:33.000
don't make the same mistakes that I made, or the same mistakes

00:38:33.000 --> 00:38:37.000
that my other whistleblowing colleagues have made.

00:38:37.000 --> 00:38:40.000
The truth has to get out there, and this is one thing about

00:38:40.000 --> 00:38:45.000
