00:38:45.000 --> 00:38:51.000
You can't keep the truth under wraps.

00:38:51.000 --> 00:38:56.000
You can't trick the American people over the long term.

00:38:56.000 --> 00:39:02.000
It's just not possible. And so I'm happy to be a part of

00:39:02.000 --> 00:39:05.000
